You will get the actual error at the task-tracker window (go to the failed/killed task, click on the full log option). My job also got failed for the error code 1. when i checked the particular task log, i saw it was due to unavailability of required package. Although i installed them, the packages were not available to other users like mapred or hdfs. So you need to re-install those in a shared location(/usr/share/R/library). I have done like following
install.packages("rJava",lib="/usr/share/R/library")
install.packages("/home/user/rmr2_3.3.0.tar.gz", repos = NULL, lib="/usr/share/R/library")

